e first time must present an official document with their name, gender, date of birth and nationality. Please read the [WCA Regulations](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations) before the competition, especially [the specific articles](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/#article-E-fewest-moves) of the competition event.\n\nLocations may be added until **March 16th 23:59 UTC** so if there isn't a location near you yet contact your local [Delegate](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/delegates).\n\n---\n\nEsta competi\u00e7\u00e3o contar\u00e1 **apenas com a modalidade 3x3x3 Menos Movimentos** e ser\u00e1 realizada em v\u00e1rios locais do Brasil e da \u00c1frica. Preste aten\u00e7\u00e3o ao **fuso hor\u00e1rio** da sua [localidade](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions\/FMCBrazilAfrica2024#41276-locations-lugares)! Competidores participando pela primeira vez s\u00e3o obrigados a apresentar na competi\u00e7\u00e3o um documento oficial com nome, g\u00eanero, data de nascimento e nacionalidade. Favor ler o [Regulamento da WCA](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/translations\/portuguese-brazilian) antes do evento, em especial [os artigos espec\u00edficos](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/translations\/portuguese-brazilian\/#article-E-fewest-moves) da modalidade da competi\u00e7\u00e3o.\n\nOs locais podem ser adicionados at\u00e9 **16 de mar\u00e7o \u00e0s 23:59 UTC**, portanto, se ainda n\u00e3o houver um local perto de voc\u00ea, entre em contato com seu [Delegado](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/delegates) local.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"FMC2020","name":"FMC 2020","city":"Multiple Cities","country":"XW","date":{"from":"2020-06-13","till":"2020-06-14","numberOfDays":2},"isCanceled":true,"events":["333fm"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Akash Rupela","email":"arupela@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Baiqiang Dong (\u8463\u767e\u5f3a)","email":"bdong@worldcubeassociation.or